bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.durability=The item lasts longer before it breaks.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.fire=The target of a melee hit burns for longer.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.fishingSpeed=The fishing rod catches fish faster.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.frostWalker=Water you walk on turns to ice.
