bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.lootBonusFishing=Fishing yields more treasure.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.mending=Experience repairs the item.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.oxygen=You can stay underwater for longer.
