bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.protect.explosion=Reduces damage and knockback from explosions.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.protect.fall=Reduces fall damage.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.protect.fire=Reduces fire and burning damage.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.protect.projectile=Reduces damage from projectiles.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.soul_speed=You walk faster on soul sand and soul soil.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.swift_sneak=You sneak faster.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.thorns=Attackers take some of the damage they deal.
